{"title":"Paul Component Engineering x Sim Works “Sunset” Collection","link":"https://theradavist.com/paul-component-engineering-x-sim-works-sunset-collection","date":1793257222000,"content":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/0cf1686f16a9adce6fca3844ee2588b0856525486b1f277071681f87ab691745.webp\" srcset=\"/media/34a801c5ec7cc499c353ae5dabe425cd773f7a7dc97483f7589c812ee8fb4607.webp 640w, /media/0cf1686f16a9adce6fca3844ee2588b0856525486b1f277071681f87ab691745.webp 1800w, /media/cb10a34180540ad4b3de08d912206269751a021a02a4569948536f412b4357bf.webp\" /></p>\n<p><em><a href=\"https://theradavist.com/tag/paul-component-engineering\" target=\"_blank\">Paul Component Engineering</a> and <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/tag/sim-works\" target=\"_blank\">Sim Works</a> team up for a limited edition “Sunset” Collection to commemorate the 2026 Bespoked Osaka Framebuilder Showcase, the first edition of the bicycle show to be held in Japan. Read below for all the red and gold details.</em></p>\n<p><span></span></p>\n<h3><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"576\" src=\"/media/4c3b8c80c5f82f6907163bca8cd57f4609c9c27f2edcb86d708a201e3de51246.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/media/4c3b8c80c5f82f6907163bca8cd57f4609c9c27f2edcb86d708a201e3de51246.webp 1600w, /media/eee38dd233efdd6acf2887283c4eda3a318fe14cc2f05114aeb2e38a661cba3b.webp 1200w, /media/b02bfd45aecab2e8baea930099fa7eafe69e21338477f5a5e43eebb1957f4efb.webp 1536w, /media/3aaf0f9e8aa5656dc4712184abcd6293391f12b4ab83483534078a3609f34c55.webp 768w\" /></h3>\n<h3>Sunset Collection</h3>\n<p>The “Sunset” Collection is a super limited collection of products built by friends Sim Works and Paul Components in Chico, California. The “Sunset” Collection celebrates the Magical Hour of light that sets in as we approach twilight. A gradient of Red gives way to Orange and Gold. Released to commemorate the inaugural Bespoke Bicycle Show in Osaka Japan, this collection culminates Sim Works’ 2026 limited anodizing offerings and beautifully complements the <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/sim-works-sunrise-collection\" target=\"_blank\">“Sunrise” collection of parts that we launched at MADE earlier this year in Portland.</a></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/a07574b2e6107089056e2b9a5b43f3cb8675068a85ca89d66c92d04045b133db.webp\" srcset=\"/media/000462cc5813905cd23ef7bbcfe8753afc7fe48f571d4aa572b26d3294a97bbe.webp 800w, /media/a07574b2e6107089056e2b9a5b43f3cb8675068a85ca89d66c92d04045b133db.webp 1600w, /media/f9f546a3eec302b76d3fea464042a5e76f9f391db441826f7f0e31a6341d4416.webp\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/cdb77bc59e72a0afe916d236dbbc1a207ed17151c1416181000f6adce0c085a9.webp\" srcset=\"/media/501c7af847fdce61ed0b9c54aa169cfa3a4487940c17d9e18ef8654c6c55ccb3.webp 800w, /media/cdb77bc59e72a0afe916d236dbbc1a207ed17151c1416181000f6adce0c085a9.webp 1600w, /media/b7e3ceae6d5038c66e7e77e01ee0f9550a869d5047d510aff693888986fb36dd.webp\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/e296119655a875463f4b92c3c1dfb76eb5f2e391d08a7d4ecfc52bbb6ee49e00.webp\" srcset=\"/media/b85b351efc853a90a821dc2ef51a80d87bb3fd5681d6599cbb647c787c9dbd7d.webp 800w, /media/e296119655a875463f4b92c3c1dfb76eb5f2e391d08a7d4ecfc52bbb6ee49e00.webp 1600w, /media/71b92ea196bfeb3c2ead39cdd115a8c2658f63dcfa07cc9f9309604030ea5065.webp\" /></p>\n<p>The collection includes Paul’s excellent mechanical braking products as a focal point, with both rim and disc brake options in both cable-pull options, as well as their corresponding levers. Distinct, custom elements adorn these parts and set them truly apart from Paul’s standard offerings.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/f6e361deec79ff77119035bc10c8f95116da4b856a3be25527351ea9592a74c2.webp\" srcset=\"/media/542eedddb56fb2ec34368b320f61dd739d8e43e901a161ca5c06ce68cd9da5c8.webp 1000w, /media/f6e361deec79ff77119035bc10c8f95116da4b856a3be25527351ea9592a74c2.webp\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/8848ffa351a552111eed34206689558fb9504c39698bea45b51f9bbf4f492b94.webp\" srcset=\"/media/6ff2fb3a97c820be67c897d546a951e4c0439ac95dbec4d2c4defde8f2519b3a.webp 1000w, /media/8848ffa351a552111eed34206689558fb9504c39698bea45b51f9bbf4f492b94.webp\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/1bb322c6432ac0b8073b2751d3cd6ebbdb588974551cc6f1d4e9ef3b713406ae.webp\" srcset=\"/media/851a7e34dc1f82237148101113d1ea59e9899967b19a4cbbbcf1c0a45505973c.webp 1000w, /media/1bb322c6432ac0b8073b2751d3cd6ebbdb588974551cc6f1d4e9ef3b713406ae.webp\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/3828e7c2bfc1355a2d6e388308ca0ae803378b71f8bbe26f14c5779bb605cc60.webp\" srcset=\"/media/ce57eece35abb3d00bc9d1e3b60ea985da78e6345a817000368a788aa6c8f32b.webp 1000w, /media/3828e7c2bfc1355a2d6e388308ca0ae803378b71f8bbe26f14c5779bb605cc60.webp\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/e2c5e51655069af164f1e4d171436cd06e0088b76b75a2f9e96b1b28ee912120.webp\" srcset=\"/media/4aaeca44763bed34206618b67faed56d69d70020090178194da3af82fc7b4607.webp 1000w, /media/e2c5e51655069af164f1e4d171436cd06e0088b76b75a2f9e96b1b28ee912120.webp\" /></p>\n<p>We’ve enjoyed this partnership and their previous collaborative efforts. This collection will serve as a testament to the relationship between an iconic American manufacturer and a beloved Japanese brand.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/85b034f8643d784697eccb5d2d92edd9c80cfdc9dad0151c140ea9518d18e36b.webp\" srcset=\"/media/f770bbca299b32665db92566252eab37520e59c37b33bc1fc49e52f1e18c8161.webp 800w, /media/638305a00a91c9a5ff518d059ae394f93948d3250b7fee948086251971f0ccb8.webp 1600w, /media/85b034f8643d784697eccb5d2d92edd9c80cfdc9dad0151c140ea9518d18e36b.webp\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/df3a234d8eb5f76f65ec276d12d4d51015bea43a37e5141fbd140f13eefd1e0b.webp\" srcset=\"/media/d8541426594079deb74b82a16d6aa457443b93df31d3243192caffba8990fc2e.webp 800w, /media/d21862e917a707dadc908cb11c4a370824eb1fa64f00e7fadd0e083f01939c05.webp 1600w, /media/df3a234d8eb5f76f65ec276d12d4d51015bea43a37e5141fbd140f13eefd1e0b.webp\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sim.works/collections/paul-x-simworks-ltd-sunset-collection\" target=\"_blank\">See the whole collection and more at Sim Works USA.</a></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/paul-component-engineering-x-sim-works-sunset-collection\">Paul Component Engineering x Sim Works “Sunset” Collection</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://cms.theradavist.com/\">The Radavist</a>.</p>","author":"Paul Kalifatidi","comments":"https://theradavist.com/paul-component-engineering-x-sim-works-sunset-collection#comments","siteTitle":"The Radavist","siteHash":"96eb481d8084f04a4602bac57874ba717baf56b758f45547b5caf2312da766ef","entryHash":"1b4c1bee771f653b839763faae7bc9912cc9f42a5e48b06a9ecab3416f22aa54","category":"Cycling"}